 Iterative Rendering using map()
AIM
To write a React program to implement iterative rendering using the map() function.
PROGRAM (App.jsx)
function App() {
 const fruits = ["Apple", "Banana", "Mango", "Orange"];
 return (
 <ul>
 {fruits.map((fruit, index) => (
 <li key={index}>{fruit}</li>
 ))}
 </ul>
 );
}
export default App;
OUTPUT
