Output in browser
HOW map() WORKS
["Apple", "Banana", "Mango",
"Orange"] → map() → 4 x <li> items on page
KEY POINTS
• map() goes through the list one item at a time.
• For each fruit, it creates one <li> — so 4 fruits = 4 list items.
• key gives each item a unique id (React shows a warning without it).
